    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class of cleanup handlers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Derived classes override method recoverResources, which makes actual work on resource recovery.</para>
<para>Cleanup handlers are stored in a double list, which is owned and managed by a crash recovery context. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
